367	     * Click the green Sheets icon
368	     * Select "Create a new spreadsheet" or link to existing
369	   - Note: This step requires manual action in the Google Forms interface
370	
371	5. **Setup Recommendations**
372	   - Suggest form settings (collect email, limit to 1 response, etc.)
373	   - Recommend data validation rules
